        "Sütun 1",
        "/ The scrolls put a spell on a weapon. When you activate it, you get the effect for a certain time. While the effect is active, you get its benefits, but bear in mind that those benefits disappear as soon as the effect is over - even in the middle of a fight! Please note: if you activate an effect, you will not be able to activate another one until the first one is recharged. / Scroll",
        "Enchantment",
        "Sütun 4",
        "Scroll",
        "Enchantment"
